  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/zipball/v12.142.0",
  "body": "## dd-trace\r\nThis release packages [dd-trace@5.118.0](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/tree/v5.118.0).\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* feat(aap): In App WAF support by @CarlesDD in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/744\r\n* chore: strip dd-trace Test Optimization validation runbook from layer by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/800\r\n* Add ap-east-2 and ap-southeast-6 to supported regions by @jcstorms1 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/802\r\n* feat: add support for extracting DSM context in event bridge by @jeastham1993 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/790\r\n* feat(handler): register dd-trace ESM loader hook programmatically by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/801\r\n* Release v12.142.0 by @jcstorms1 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/803\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/compare/v12.141.0...v12.142.0\r\n\r\n## Layer ARNs\r\n\r\n```\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node18-x:142\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node20-x:142\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node22-x:142\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node24-x:142\r\n\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node18-x:142\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node20-x:142\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node22-x:142\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node24-x:142\r\n```\r\n",
